@startuml
title Weather Monitoring System State Machine Diagram

state Unregistered as Unregistered
Unregistered : entry/No account created
Unregistered : do/New user registration
Unregistered : exit/Register successfully or fail

state Registered as Registered
Registered : entry/Account created
Registered : do/Login to existing account
Registered : exit/Login successful or failed

state LoggedIn as LoggedIn
LoggedIn : entry/Login successful
LoggedIn : do/Check weather for current location or another location
LoggedIn : exit/Location entered is valid or not

state ViewingWeatherDetails as ViewingWeatherDetails
ViewingWeatherDetails : entry/Valid location and user chooses to check the weather
ViewingWeatherDetails : do/Update and show selected weather information
ViewingWeatherDetails : exit/User chooses additional details or logs out

state EndingSession as EndingSession
EndingSession : entry/User logs out
EndingSession : do/End session
EndingSession : exit/System ends

[*] --> Unregistered

Unregistered --> Registered : [Successful registration]
Registered --> LoggedIn : [Successful login]

LoggedIn --> ViewingWeatherDetails : [Valid location entered and user chooses to check the weather]

ViewingWeatherDetails --> LoggedIn : [User chooses additional details or logs out]
ViewingWeatherDetails --> EndingSession : [User logs out]

EndingSession --> [*] : [System ends]

@enduml
